WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.381
Every small business already has its numbers.

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:12.709
Sales in Xero. Costs in a spreadsheet. Orders, invoices, pickups, all in different places.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.568
On their own, they can't tell you very much.

4
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:23.627
So I bring them together. I clean them up, match them, and check every figure, so the numbers you see are numbers you can trust.

5
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:30.329
Then I turn them into clear dashboards, built around the questions you actually ask.

6
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:35.103
Which products make money. Where costs are creeping up. What's really changing.

7
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.597
So you can stop guessing, and make your next decision with confidence.

8
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.493
I'm Gabriela Olivera. I help small businesses turn their existing data into clear, practical insights.

9
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.587
Your business has the numbers. Let's find the story.
